Source: @DISTRO_ID@-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: important
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: @DISTRO_HOME_URL@
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @DISTRO_ID@-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ apt repository signing key
 The public key that signs the @DISTRO_NAME@ apt repository, installed to
 /etc/apt/keyrings/ so a sources entry can bind the repository to it.

Package: @DISTRO_ID@-apt-source
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, @DISTRO_ID@-archive-keyring
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ apt repository sources entry
 The deb822 sources entry that points apt at the @DISTRO_NAME@ repository and
 binds it to the key from @DISTRO_ID@-archive-keyring. Installed by the
 @DISTRO_NAME@ image builder; it is what makes the repository's own updates,
 including a changed repository location, reach installed systems.
